    {
      "id": "claim_dd79400ff5024afda922b533b45aa5f5",
      "statement": "The `config` subcommand dispatches through run_config in main.rs, which resolves a save path from the `--config` override or `Config::default_path()` and calls claudebar::tui::run(path); without the `tui` feature it prints that the configurator is unavailable and points the user at editing the TOML directly, returning a failure exit code.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/cli.rs#L78-L96",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e58d38d0a126997c140a0cbe03f18f60a89da8999d8a968b914179ccee708e53:"
