    {
      "id": "claim_476843e039904c1e821f4b1df3c0f00e",
      "statement": "The live preview renders through the exact same render path as the hook: preview::render resolves the theme and style from the edited config and calls render_with with a fixed FIXED_NOW epoch and fixed /home/me home prefix for determinism, then converts the resulting ANSI string into a ratatui Text via ansi_to_tui::IntoText, so there is structurally no second render path for the preview to diverge on.",
